  [1mThree decisions worth your veto[0m

  1. [1mYou aren't notified of your own changes.[0m Self-authored events are filtered out.
  2. [1mUnfollowing hides a task's past notifications, not just future ones.[0m This falls directly out of B — the feed is a
     live derived view, not a frozen history. It's arguably more correct, and it's definitely surprising. Approach A
